<title>USA: Mellon Bank may set $300 mln corp debt deal.</title>
<headline>Mellon Bank may set $300 mln corp debt deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mellon Bank Corp is expected to tap the corporate bond primary market with a $300 million debt offering, syndicate sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The A2/A-rated deal is expected to consist of a 10-year maturity with price talk seen at between 68 and 70 basis points over comparable U.S. Treasuries, sources said.</p>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston is expected to serve as lead underwriter for the offering, they said.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
